domain -> repo -> dto ->nailService -> mapper -> serviceimpl -> controller

Domain

@GETTER ,@SETTER
@Entity, -> mean table represent in Database
@Table(name = "services") -> table linking with table name
@Id ->entity class as the primary key. It designates that this field uniquely identifies each record within a database table
@GeneratedValue(strategy =  GenerationType.IDENTITY ) -> to let the database handle the generation of primary keys using an auto-increment or identity column.





